              <h3 dir="auto">Overview</h3>
              <div class="overview" dir="auto">
                  <p>A shy woman is unexpectedly cast in a local production of an original musical. Under the spell of the strong-willed and enigmatic director, she loses herself in the role and the high-stakes world of this community theater production.</p>
